:false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-20T05:37:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T08:30:09Z","closed_at":"2026-08-20T08:30:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122623","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122623.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122623.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds unit tests for `FontVariation`, one of the remaining open slots on the unit test tracker (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/43440).\n\n## What's covered\n\nTwo test cases in `tests/scene/test_font_variation.cpp`:\n\n1. **Variation settings roundtrip** — set/get roundtrips for `variation_opentype`, `variation_embolden`, `variation_transform`, and `variation_face_index`, plus reset-to-default checks. No font loading required.\n2. **Base font delegation** — with a `FontFile` loaded from the existing `thirdparty/fonts/Inter_Regular.woff2` test asset, verifies that a `FontVariation` with no variation applied reports the base font's name/style/weight and identical metrics (`get_height`, `get_ascent`, `get_descent`, `get_string_size`). Guarded by `#ifdef MODULE_FREETYPE_ENABLED`, same as `test_fontfile.cpp`.\n\nNo new assets or build-system changes: `tests/SCsub` auto-globs `test_*.cpp`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Every API used was cross-checked against `scene/resources/font.h` / `font.cpp` on master (e.g. `FontVariation::_get_rid()` delegates to `base_font->find_variation(...)`, so unvaried metrics match the base font).\n- Not compiled locally (no Godot build environment available); the engine test suite runs on CI for this PR.\n\n> [!INFO] *AI disclosure*: This contribution was prepared with AI assistance on behalf of karlsune, who reviewed the change and the referenced API surface.